# QuizNova Web Client Environment Configuration Template

# Google OAuth Client ID (Get this from Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Credentials)
# IMPORTANT: Remember to add your production domain into "Authorized JavaScript origins"
# in the Google Cloud Console credentials page (e.g., https://your-quiznova.vercel.app).
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=962047454671-aas2vjadtovjebirovvuo9p3t4afc9tj.apps.googleusercontent.com

# Backend API URL
# In local development: http://localhost:5001
# In production: https://your-backend-api-url.onrender.com (or your custom domain)
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5001
